### Summary

The production change looks correct. The manager shares one deadline between resolution and fetch. `gitdefault.Resolve` keeps local reads on `ctx` after `remoteCtx` expires. The router and the manager both fall back to `ResolveDefaultBranch` when an adapter has no budgeted resolver. The one finding is in the new test: its 250ms threshold is above 4×25ms, so it would still pass if each repository got its own budget.

